msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Kashiwagi's too soft! Life's been tough ever since he started callin' the "
"shots..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Damn straight! Playin' nice so the cops don't bother us? Where's the fun in "
"that? We accountants now or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I hear none of the organizations have been able to collect much protection "
"money. Only ones makin' any dough 'round here are the Hakuho Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Man, fuck those guys! We're out here bustin' our asses while they rake it "
"in at the stock market!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Maybe the Nishikiyama Family's got the right idea. Their boss does whatever "
"the hell he wants. Old man Kashiwagi won't be around much longer, I bet..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"That'll mean another war in Kamurocho... This never would've happened if "
"Kashiwagi had just kept his shit together..."
msgstr ""

